- That I send the message to Dr. Jennifer Lee at Harbor General for you (I can prepare and send if you confirm you want that)?

Tell me the answers to the clarifying questions (diabetes diagnosis, current diabetes meds, confirmation about anticoagulation/INR, and any joint symptoms) and I’ll draft the precise email/script or checklist you can bring to the appointment.

