While you check those, here’s a focused, practical plan and suggested questions to use at your annual with Dr. Jennifer Lee (Harbor General), covering type 2 diabetes management and whether to refer to Northwest Orthopedics.

1) Labs and tests to request before/at the visit
- A1c (or most recent A1c result) — primary diabetes control measure
- Fasting glucose (if A1c not available)
- Basic metabolic panel (BMP) with eGFR and electrolytes — for kidney function and med safety
- Urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio (UACR) — screening for diabetic kidney disease
