- “I’m here for my annual. I have a history of hypertension, anemia, and retinopathy. I want to review diabetes control (A1c, meds, kidney and eye screening) and discuss whether my joint symptoms (or risk factors) warrant a referral to orthopedics. Also want to confirm my INR/anticoagulation plan and whether I need any imaging or DEXA.”

