I can help you prepare. A few quick clarifying questions first so I can tailor the plan correctly:
- Do you already have a diagnosis of type 2 diabetes? If so, what is your most recent A1c and any diabetes medications you’re taking?
- Are you taking an anticoagulant (warfarin)? You wrote “last INR was 320” — do you mean 3.20?
