A. Questions to ask about type 2 diabetes management
(Use these to guide the appointment — pick the most important 6–10 for time-limited visits.)

Monitoring and targets
1. What should my current A1c target be given my age (52), comorbidities (hypertension, retinopathy), and any other risks?
2. How often should I have A1c checked? Do you recommend home glucose monitoring (frequency and targets)?
